WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000 line:16 position:50% size:80% align:middle
Recently people have been asking if you can get craft mix through TSA.

00:02.000 --> 00:05.000 line:16 position:50% size:80% align:middle
You know I travel on a budget, so here I am stopping at my backpack.

00:05.000 --> 00:07.000 line:16 position:50% size:80% align:middle
Wow, that was not good.

00:07.000 --> 00:09.000 line:16 position:50% size:80% align:middle
So here I am standing in the TSA line.

00:09.000 --> 00:12.000 line:16 position:50% size:80% align:middle
Yeah. Oh wow, that was really bad, Jim.

00:12.000 --> 00:15.000 line:16 position:50% size:80% align:middle
I don't know what my vision was, but here I am walking through the airport.

00:15.000 --> 00:17.000 line:16 position:50% size:80% align:middle
Oh, and look at that.

00:17.000 --> 00:19.000 line:16 position:50% size:80% align:middle
We got it through TSA.

00:19.000 --> 00:21.000 line:16 position:50% size:80% align:middle
Hollywood magic. Now I'm on the plane.

00:21.000 --> 00:24.000 line:16 position:50% size:80% align:middle
You know I was the only person on that flight that got a mocktail for under $2.
